s custom web app development, mobile app development, AI product integration, cloud infrastructure, DevOps, backend development, API architecture, and UI/UX engineering."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Kryvazent help startups and growing businesses?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Kryvazent works with startups, growing businesses, and organizations that need reliable software engineering for new products, modernization, automation, or scalable digital systems."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I start a project with Kryvazent?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can contact Kryvazent by email, phone, or the website contact form with a short description of your product, business goal, timeline, and technical needs."}}]}]}4:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-background relative overflow-hidden","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$9"}}],"$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}],null,"$L16"]}]
